    <description>Junction linking an Opportunity (gift) to a donor&apos;s Annual Giving Summary, carrying the credited Amount and a Credit Type (Hard or Soft). Master-detail to the Annual Giving Summary so hard/soft totals roll up to the correct fiscal-year record — no fiscal-year date math needed. JSI-90 Moves Management. Author: Jason Ott.</description>
